<!-- Six URLs, one per indexable route. 404.html is noindex and is deliberately
     absent.

     No <changefreq> and no <priority>: Google ignores both outright and has said
     so since 2015, so they were two more things to keep in sync for nothing.
     <lastmod> is the one element it does read, and only while the dates stay
     honest — a file that claims yesterday and last changed a year ago teaches
     the crawler to stop believing the whole sitemap. Update the date on a page
     when that page's content changes, not on every deploy. -->
